+
+## Request
+
+Add a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, for bulk import from spreadsheets.
+Each line of `text` is `title;priority;tags` (priority may be empty for normal; tags separated by spaces).
+Blank lines are skipped. Valid lines are added to the list; the result is `{ imported, rejected }`, where
+`rejected` lists `{ line, reason }` (line counted from 1, blank lines included in the count).
+
+## Done
+
+- `src/domain/import.ts`: `importTasks`, validation delegated to `list.add`; a line with more than three
+  fields is rejected. Duplicates (in the list or earlier in the text) are rejected.
+- Tests in `test/import.test.ts`.
